So, thank you, man.

00:09:46.567 --> 00:09:48.434
-Oh, I love you, man.
-Cheers.

00:09:48.434 --> 00:09:49.901
Love you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:49.901 --> 00:09:51.467
-I appreciate that.

00:09:51.467 --> 00:09:53.667
♪♪

00:09:53.667 --> 00:09:55.033
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:09:55.033 --> 00:09:57.133
Here's Dwayne Johnson
in "Black Adam."

00:09:57.133 --> 00:09:59.834
Take a look at this.

00:09:59.834 --> 00:10:01.934
-I told you
to stop killing people!

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:03.467
-They look alive to me.

00:10:03.467 --> 00:10:05.067
-Because I saved them.

00:10:05.067 --> 00:10:06.734
-Well, that's why I waited
until you were there.

00:10:06.734 --> 00:10:09.767
I got the information I needed.
No one died.

00:10:09.767 --> 00:10:13.634
I did it your way.
-He does have a point.

00:10:13.634 --> 00:10:15.667
-I know it got lost
in all the confusion,

00:10:15.667 --> 00:10:18.067
but we still have
some issues to settle here.

00:10:18.067 --> 00:10:22.334
There are only heroes
and there are villains.

00:10:22.334 --> 00:10:24.000
-You think yourself a hero,

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.834
but you would let
these criminals go free.

00:10:25.834 --> 00:10:28.334
-Heroes don't kill people.

00:10:28.334 --> 00:10:31.968
♪♪

00:10:31.968 --> 00:10:33.234
-Well, I do.

00:10:33.234 --> 00:10:36.267
-That's exactly right!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:36.267 --> 00:10:38.834
"I do."
-"I do."

00:10:38.834 --> 00:10:39.868
Black Adam does.

00:10:39.868 --> 00:10:41.434
-Thank you, again,
for being here.

00:10:41.434 --> 00:10:43.734
-Oh, absolutely, man.
-The New York City premiere

00:10:43.734 --> 00:10:46.534
of "Black Adam" is tonight,
and so you have to run.

00:10:46.534 --> 00:10:49.834
Tonight, biggest premiere
of my life,

00:10:49.834 --> 00:10:51.667
biggest movie
of my entire career.

00:10:51.667 --> 00:10:52.701
We are celebrating here.

00:10:52.701 --> 00:10:55.234
We've come back home
to New York City.

00:10:55.234 --> 00:10:58.767
The big global premiere
of "Black Adam," black carpet,

00:10:58.767 --> 00:11:01.033
we have locked down
Times Square tonight.

00:11:01.033 --> 00:11:04.133
Every theater
is "Black Adam'd" out.

00:11:04.133 --> 00:11:05.968
And I want to raise this glass.

00:11:05.968 --> 00:11:08.467
I raised it to you.
We raised it to "Black Adam."

00:11:08.467 --> 00:11:10.033
Now I want to raise this
to all of you

00:11:10.033 --> 00:11:12.334
because all of you are coming
tonight to the premiere.

00:11:12.334 --> 00:11:14.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:14.167 --> 00:11:21.801
♪♪

00:11:21.801 --> 00:11:23.968
-That's what I'm talking about!

00:11:23.968 --> 00:11:26.501
Thanks to our friends --

00:11:26.501 --> 00:11:28.567
Thanks to our friends at IMAX!

00:11:28.567 --> 00:11:29.834
-Thank you
to our friends at IMAX!

00:11:29.834 --> 00:11:31.801
-You're gonna see it at the
biggest theater tonight!

00:11:31.801 --> 00:11:33.801
-Tonight!
-With Dwayne Johnson!

00:11:33.801 --> 00:11:37.767
"Black Adam" is in theaters
and IMAX October 21st.

00:11:37.767 --> 00:11:39.267
Dwayne and I are doing
something fun after the break.

00:11:39.267 --> 00:11:41.801
Stick around.
That's how you do it, bud!

